# --- Model weights ---
# GGUF models are multi-GB; never belongs in git. Download via README instructions.
models/*.gguf
models/*.bin
models/*.safetensors

# --- llama.cpp runtime binaries ---
# Fetched by setup.bat (or manually from the llama.cpp releases page).
# Keeping them out of git keeps the repo small and avoids shipping stale binaries.
*.exe
*.dll

# --- Runtime scratch data ---
# Recreated by Run-Office-AI.bat on every launch (Edge --user-data-dir profile)
# and shredded on exit. Never commit browser profile/cache data.
temp/
dyn_args.txt

# --- OS / editor noise ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
